111
00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.370
And we all were like, ah, and we were like, mom.

112
00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:42.150
And it was a story I told where they were like, who's the prankster in your family?

113
00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.890
I'm like, my mom was kind of a prankster.

114
00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:44.790
I told this one story.

115
00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:49.990
I'm like, oh my gosh, are there people somewhere in the world that think I have like a foot

116
00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:52.030
