00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:24.210
And somehow the telephone game has turned this into something else.

127
00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.890
Here's the thing I'm going to say.

128
00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.910
If you're going to have an AI bot get something horribly wrong,

129
00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:33.330
maybe the jewelry tidbit is better than the like collects body parts.

130
00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.350
Can we just say that?

131
00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.910
It does make me feel a little better.

132
00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.390
I haven't told my mom the story, you guys, but I feel like I need to.

133
00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:45.090
Because I feel like there's going to be someone at church that comes up to her and is like,

134
00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.630
Birdie, what's up with you and this foot?

135
00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:47.210
What's with the feet?

136
00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.590
Well, Angela, I do appreciate you telling that story because I had the grumps and now I'm laughing.

137
00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.470
