00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.040
Yes.

334
00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:17.060
And I also had two other name tags on the show, which was Calvin and Lester.

335
00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:17.980
That's right.

336
00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:18.380
Yes.

