00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.920
That's a little Office trivia.

338
00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.540
I feel like they played this trivia game at bars and stuff, and that's a good one.

339
00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:23.920
Yeah.

340
00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:24.380
Yeah.

341
00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.880
So who did you start as?

342
00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.820
Lester and then Calvin and then Glenn?

